  "anchor_order": "validated base growth+real equipment ranges+sect+direct flat sources; sum one instance contribution per named qigong/effective grade; apply min/max clipping rule below; then declared percent/buff/rage/weakening modifiers. Gas conversion reads corresponding nonfeedback defense anchor after its declared modifiers.",
